# Keep Docker build context hermetic: never ship local build artifacts or
# dev caches into the image. Without this, a locally-generated C++ build/
# dir (with a host-absolute CMakeCache.txt) leaks into the cv-inference-cpp
# image and breaks the in-container `cmake -B build`.
**/build/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
.venv/
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
